WEBVTT

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:03.680
Give, and it will be given to you.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.190
For the measure you give will be the measure you get back.

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:12.320
One blind man cannot lead another!

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.980
If he does they will both fall into a ditch.

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:21.140
Why do you see the speck that is in your brother's eye but pay no attention to the log in your own eye?
